          'Many cosmetic brands in the region started as private-label suppliers or as salon and makeup-artist businesses. They know the products well, but online selling asks for different skills: swatch photography, creator management, launch planning and replies on Instagram at all hours. A cosmetics marketing agency in Coimbatore should fill that gap without losing the practical knowledge the founders already have.',
