          'The Kongu wedding season, Pongal, the Aadi sales, Deepavali and Karthigai Deepam all bring makeup demand, but in different ways. Weddings bring long-wear base, kajal and lip colour for long functions; festivals bring gift sets and smaller treats. Coimbatore’s drier air is kinder to makeup than coastal humidity, yet long outdoor functions in strong sun still test any product, so describe wear honestly.',
          'Plan launches five or six weeks ahead. Confirm stock for every shade, shoot swatches, seed products with creators, build a waitlist on Instagram and WhatsApp, then put ads and listings live on the same day. Gift boxes travel further when the buyer cannot pick the wrong shade, so build them from nail colours, brush sets, kajal and lip kits in universal tones.',
